      "text": "The \u201clone gunman\u201d bit is the best. How they should team up with the government- they always kill people that benefit them.\n\nIt\u2019s a natural fit.\n\nPlus I\u2019m running for mayor of London in \u201828.\n\n\nTucker Carlson (@TuckerCarlson)\n\nWhen politicians tell you they\u2019re Christians, it makes you wonder if Jesus endorses greed, violence and arrogance. Russell Brand answers that question in his new book, How to Become a Christian in 7 Days.\n\n0:00 Image, Ego, and How the Word Changes You\n13:38 The Forces of Goo",
